{"t":"Knight Outfits Quest","s":"knight-outfits-quest-bc11d","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Outfit_Knight_Male_Addon_3_9ff803.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Knight Outfits Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Knight Addons Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(60+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>If you spend your time fighting monsters and need that little extra protection, this well-armored outfit is great for you. Addons are usually awarded by knight guilds.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Sabrehaven\">Sabrehaven</a> (NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a>) and <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> (NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>).\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Creatures on the way to the last of mission of <a href=\"#/quest/the-ape-city-quest\">The Ape City Quest</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Spawn\">Serpent Spawns</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra\">Hydras</a>, and more). You might also have to fight more creatures in order to obtain certain items, but it is recommended to buy them from players instead.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Addons for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Outfits\">Knight Outfits</a> &amp; the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/In%20Shining%20Armor\">In Shining Armor</a>. <br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Knight Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Knight_Male_Addon_3_9ff803.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Knight Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Knight_Female_Addon_3_b3c918.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Outfit\">Outfit</span></h3>\n<p>These outfits may be selected by any player. Only the addons are included in this quest.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sword\">Sword</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Knight Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Knight_Male_Addon_1_1e137d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Knight Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Knight_Female_Addon_1_0b8ecb.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h4>\n<ul><li>100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Huge%20Chunk%20of%20Crude%20Iron\">Huge Chunk of Crude Iron</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h4>\n<p>You can obtain all of the items listed above before you start this quest. You are advised to collect the items before you talk to the NPC.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Collect <a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> either from all kind of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarves\">Dwarves</a> or specific <a href=\"#/wiki/Geo-Elementals\">Geo-Elementals</a>, such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a>.</li>\n<li>Obtain the <a href=\"#/wiki/Huge%20Chunk%20of%20Crude%20Iron\">crude iron</a> by trading a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Sword\">Giant Sword</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Sweaty%20Cyclops\">A Sweaty Cyclops</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>.</li>\n<li>Talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Sabrehaven\">Sabrehaven</a> and ask him about <b>forge</b>. He will tell you that he can forge you either a Knight's Sword or a Warrior's Sword. Tell him you want a <b>Knight's Sword</b>.</li>\n<li>He will tell you to bring him 100 pieces of iron ore and one piece of crude iron. Once you bring him the items, he will give you the sword addon.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Helmet\">Helmet</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Knight Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Knight_Male_Addon_2_d5437c.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Knight Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Knight_Female_Addon_2_364a9a.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment_2\">Required Equipment</span></h4>\n<ul><li>100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Perfect%20Behemoth%20Fang\">Perfect Behemoth Fangs</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Damaged%20Steel%20Helmet\">Damaged Steel Helmet</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Warrior%27s%20Sweat\">Flask of Warrior's Sweat</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Royal%20Steel\">Piece of Royal Steel</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method_2\">Method</span></h4>\n<p>All of the items listed above may be collected before you start the mission (except the <a href=\"#/wiki/Damaged%20Steel%20Helmet\">Damaged Steel Helmet</a>). You are advised to collect these items before you visit the NPC.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a> and ask him about his outfit. He will tell you that you must prove your worthiness to wear such an adorned helmet.</li>\n<li>First you must collect 100 Behemoth Fangs by looting and/or <a href=\"#/wiki/Skinning\">Skinning</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a>'s.</li>\n<li>You are then sent to retrieve the <a href=\"#/wiki/Damaged%20Steel%20Helmet\">helmet of Ramsay the Reckless</a> found behind a sealed door in <a href=\"#/wiki/Banuta\">Banuta</a>'s final quest room, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32862,32522,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32862, 32522, 11)</a>.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><b>Warning:</b> If you didn't talk to Gregor first about the <a href=\"#/wiki/Damaged%20Steel%20Helmet\">Ramsay the Reckless Helmet</a> in Banuta you will not be able to open the door to get it!</dd></dl>\n<ul><li>You must now obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Warrior%27s%20Sweat\">Flask of Warrior's Sweat</a> by trading 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmets</a> to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shopkeeper%20NPCs\">Magic Shopkeeper</a> Djinns in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> Towers or looting from <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Gladiator\">Undead Gladiators</a>.</li>\n<li>Lastly you are asked to bring Royal Steel. It can be obtained by trading a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crown%20Armor\">Crown Armor</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Sweaty%20Cyclops\">A Sweaty Cyclops</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> or looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Plaguesmith\">Plaguesmiths</a>.</li>\n<li>Once you have all of the items needed, return to <a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a> and he will send you to <a href=\"#/wiki/Sam\">Sam</a> to adorn your helmet. Wait 2 hours to get your new helmet.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sword_2\">Sword</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a>: Hello there.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Weapons</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a>: Would you rather be interested in a knight's sword or in a warrior's sword?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Knights sword</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a>: Great! Simply bring me 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> and one Crude Iron and I will happily forge it for you.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Knight Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><b>After collecting all items</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a>: Hello there.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Forge Weapon</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a>: What would you like me to forge for you? A knight's sword or a warrior's sword?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Knights sword</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Morgan\">Morgan</a>: Alright! As a matter of fact, I have one in store. Here you go!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Knight Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Helmet_2\">Helmet</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Greetings, <i>Player</i>. What do you want?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Outfit</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Only the bravest warriors may wear adorned helmets. They are traditionally awarded after having completed a difficult task for our guild.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Task</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: You mean, you would like to prove that you deserve to wear such a helmet?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Well then, listen closely. First, you will have to prove that you are a fierce and restless warrior by bringing me 100 perfect behemoth fangs. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Secondly, please retrieve a helmet for us which has been lost a long time ago. The famous Ramsay the Reckless wore it when exploring an ape settlement. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Third, we need a new flask of warrior's sweat. We've run out of it recently, but we need a small amount for the show battles in our arena. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Lastly, I will have our smith refine your helmet if you bring me royal steel, an especially noble metal. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Did you understand everything I told you and are willing to handle this task?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Alright then. Come back to me once you have collected 100 perfect behemoth fangs.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Knight Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><b>After collecting 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Perfect%20Behemoth%20Fang\">Perfect Behemoth Fangs</a></b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Behemoth fangs</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Have you really managed to fulfil the task and brought me 100 perfect behemoth fangs?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: I'm deeply impressed, (brave Knight) <i>Player</i>. (Even if you are not a knight, you certainly possess knight qualities.) Now, please retrieve Ramsay's helmet.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Knight Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><b>After retrieving the <a href=\"#/wiki/Damaged%20Steel%20Helmet\">Damaged Steel Helmet</a></b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Ramsay the Reckless Helmet</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Did you recover the helmet of Ramsay the Reckless?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Good work, (brave Knight) <i>Player</i>! Even though it is damaged, it has a lot of sentimental value. Now, please bring me warrior's sweat.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Knight Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><b>After obtaining a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Warrior%27s%20Sweat\">Flask of Warrior's Sweat</a></b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Warrior's sweat</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Were you able to get hold of a flask with pure warrior's sweat?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a>: Now that is a pleasant surprise, (brave Knight) <i>Player</i>! There is only one task left now: Obtain royal steel to have your helmet refined.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div st